WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:03.280
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.280 --> 00:05.870
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.540 --> 00:09.940
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.640 --> 00:14.650
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.020 --> 00:17.550
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:17.890 --> 00:21.330
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.080 --> 00:28.300
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:28.980 --> 00:34.060
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:34.860 --> 00:37.350
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.350 --> 00:39.960
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.480 --> 00:47.740
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.710 --> 00:51.470
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.530 --> 00:54.370
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.660 --> 00:55.690
♪Let me♪

00:55.880 --> 00:59.960
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.410 --> 01:03.090
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.380 --> 01:06.080
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.250 --> 01:07.720
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.720 --> 01:11.890
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.250 --> 01:22.500
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:23.930 --> 01:29.480
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.680 --> 01:32.400
=Episode 17=

02:03.120 --> 02:03.720
Let's go.

02:21.200 --> 02:21.720
Look at this.

02:21.720 --> 02:22.520
So beautiful!

02:23.280 --> 02:24.240
Truly lovely.

02:26.030 --> 02:27.000
Where are

02:27.000 --> 02:28.600
Mr. Cheng and Miss Song?

02:29.360 --> 02:30.520
They must've seen something

02:30.520 --> 02:31.680
delicious or entertaining.

02:31.920 --> 02:32.800
Leave them alone.

02:33.480 --> 02:36.680
- Great!
- Great!

02:36.800 --> 02:37.520
What's this?

02:37.640 --> 02:38.760
- Great!
- Great!

02:39.000 --> 02:39.680
Well...

02:39.680 --> 02:40.280
Impressive!

02:40.280 --> 02:41.440
It's called Plucking Spring.

02:43.240 --> 02:44.240
Plucking Spring?

02:44.640 --> 02:46.400
The Water God Festival

02:46.440 --> 02:48.320
is a festival for lovers.

02:48.880 --> 02:50.360
Besides worshiping the Water God,

02:50.360 --> 02:51.360
we prepare programs

02:51.360 --> 02:52.320
for couples.

02:52.600 --> 02:53.440
The Plucking Spring

02:53.560 --> 02:54.800
is one of the traditions.

02:55.040 --> 02:56.040
Look, on that tall bridge

02:56.120 --> 02:56.960
hangs a wooden ball

02:57.160 --> 02:58.360
containing the first cluster

02:58.360 --> 02:59.200
of winter jasmine

02:59.200 --> 03:00.840
that bloomed in spring.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.520
Whoever retrieves it

03:02.600 --> 03:03.400
the fastest

03:03.400 --> 03:04.640
wins the Plucking Spring.

03:06.600 --> 03:07.280
I see.

03:13.560 --> 03:14.120
Good.

03:14.680 --> 03:15.920
The winner

03:16.520 --> 03:17.600
gets a grand prize.

03:18.079 --> 03:18.920
What kind of prizes

03:19.040 --> 03:19.880
are there?

03:20.360 --> 03:22.670
All sorts of treasures

03:22.760 --> 03:23.820
you can imagine.

03:25.520 --> 03:26.800
Looks like you are

03:26.800 --> 03:27.560
interested.

03:27.800 --> 03:28.840
Let's check it out.

03:32.880 --> 03:33.400
Okay.

03:35.040 --> 03:38.920
- Great!
- Great!

03:39.760 --> 03:40.280
Good.

03:40.280 --> 03:42.579
- Great!
- Great!

03:43.280 --> 03:44.360
That's Mr. Qiao.

03:51.480 --> 03:52.560
What kind of whip

03:52.560 --> 03:53.560
is this?

03:53.920 --> 03:54.920
You've got a good eye!

03:55.280 --> 03:56.840
This is Ziyu Whip, the biggest prize

03:56.920 --> 03:58.440
for the Plucking Spring.

03:59.560 --> 04:00.800
Seems you

04:00.800 --> 04:02.240
really like this whip.

04:03.480 --> 04:05.200
It's quite a unique whip.

04:06.640 --> 04:07.560
Since you like it,

04:07.720 --> 04:10.080
I'll get it for you.

04:13.280 --> 04:14.880
Let her husband

04:15.200 --> 04:16.959
win it for his wife instead.

04:20.480 --> 04:21.560
Honey.

04:21.640 --> 04:22.880
Don't even think about it.

04:23.800 --> 04:24.960
I'm already thinking.

04:27.200 --> 04:29.280
If I don't have to pretend

04:29.440 --> 04:31.790
to be elegant and delicate,

04:32.040 --> 04:33.880
I'd compete to get it myself.

04:36.720 --> 04:37.640
You really want that?

04:38.190 --> 04:38.770
Hmm.

04:39.400 --> 04:41.200
Fine weapons are rare.

04:41.440 --> 04:42.360
Missing this chance

04:42.480 --> 04:43.520
would be a pity.

04:48.920 --> 04:49.760
I'll compete.

04:51.200 --> 04:51.880
Are you sure?

04:52.920 --> 04:53.480
Yes.

04:54.680 --> 04:55.360
Anyway I can't

04:55.920 --> 04:56.960
let my wife down.

05:05.520 --> 05:08.240
- Great!
- Great!

05:08.400 --> 05:09.360
Honey.

05:09.960 --> 05:11.840
Be careful.

05:13.280 --> 05:14.160
Don't worry, Honey.

05:26.320 --> 05:27.560
- Awesome!
- Awesome!

05:28.040 --> 05:28.760
Look out!

05:29.120 --> 05:30.160
Amazing!

05:48.159 --> 05:48.840
- Great!
- Great!

05:51.150 --> 05:56.050
(Enjoy the beauty and harmony of spring)

06:02.680 --> 06:03.680
That's my nephew.

06:18.680 --> 06:19.640
This is the Ziyu Whip.

06:20.480 --> 06:21.080
Here you go.

06:25.320 --> 06:25.840
Thank you.

06:26.240 --> 06:26.900
My pleasure.

06:27.120 --> 06:28.080
As long as you're happy.

06:29.640 --> 06:30.760
I'm genuinely happy.

07:01.560 --> 07:02.880
How come

07:03.040 --> 07:04.040
Mr. Cui and the ladies

07:04.040 --> 07:04.760
disappeared?

07:05.320 --> 07:06.320
Probably they wanted us

07:06.320 --> 07:07.680
to have privacy.

07:09.280 --> 07:10.120
It's quite weird

07:10.120 --> 07:11.520
to hear you

07:11.560 --> 07:12.760
say something like that

07:13.120 --> 07:14.640
in a cold tone.

07:51.040 --> 07:51.760
Let's go.

07:53.400 --> 07:54.130
Make one for her.

07:55.560 --> 07:56.200
No need.

07:56.960 --> 07:57.490
Make one.

07:57.870 --> 07:58.480
Alright.

08:06.600 --> 08:07.600
If we buy this,

08:08.080 --> 08:09.440
we can't take it when we leave.

08:09.760 --> 08:10.720
Why waste money?

08:10.800 --> 08:11.880
Don't you like it?

08:12.720 --> 08:13.760
If you do, then get one.

08:14.440 --> 08:15.640
If you don't pursue something

08:15.680 --> 08:16.520
you fear to lose,

08:17.160 --> 08:18.200
that'd be rather dull.

08:21.640 --> 08:22.160
Today,

08:22.840 --> 08:23.440
you can

08:23.440 --> 08:24.720
do everything you wish to do

08:25.360 --> 08:26.440
without worries.

08:28.320 --> 08:29.480
Just be your true self

08:30.120 --> 08:31.080
as you've always been.

08:31.840 --> 08:32.760
Whatever you like

08:33.440 --> 08:34.280
and dislike,

08:35.280 --> 08:36.280
just say it outright.

08:37.720 --> 08:38.720
Don't hold it back.

08:41.720 --> 08:42.679
Can I truly

08:43.159 --> 08:44.800
do whatever I want?

08:47.000 --> 08:47.880
Do as you please.

08:50.960 --> 08:51.500
Alright.

08:51.920 --> 08:52.880
Do as I please.

08:56.920 --> 08:58.360
Miss, your dough figurine is ready.

08:59.600 --> 09:00.160
Thank you.

09:00.640 --> 09:01.160
My pleasure.

09:15.160 --> 09:15.720
Have a look.

09:16.120 --> 09:16.960
Does it look like me?

09:18.280 --> 09:19.200
It's better than you.

09:20.850 --> 09:22.160
Turns out I do

09:22.680 --> 09:24.110
look like a woman.

09:24.240 --> 09:25.240
You are a woman.

09:38.080 --> 09:39.560
We followed the faintest clues

09:39.680 --> 09:41.000
to trace Chai Anxi.

09:41.560 --> 09:42.800
But when I reached his hideout,

09:42.960 --> 09:43.760
I was still late.

09:45.640 --> 09:46.360
I'm sorry.

09:46.720 --> 09:47.440
Please punish me.

09:48.760 --> 09:49.320
Keep looking.

09:50.120 --> 09:50.740
Yes.

09:55.320 --> 09:57.160
Perhaps we should go back.

09:58.520 --> 09:59.520
We're Qiao Huanqing

09:59.520 --> 10:00.280
and Wen Yuyan.

10:00.760 --> 10:01.920
We must keep acting.

10:16.600 --> 10:18.400
Is Chai Anxi a cockroach?

10:18.800 --> 10:19.720
He's so good at hiding.

10:20.120 --> 10:20.640
No worries.

10:21.080 --> 10:22.000
He can't escape Jiyang.

10:22.720 --> 10:23.680
I will search everywhere

10:23.800 --> 10:24.720
for him.

10:25.720 --> 10:26.220
Look!

10:26.360 --> 10:26.880
A snake.

10:27.040 --> 10:27.800
Throw it back!

10:27.960 --> 10:28.720
I hate snakes!

10:29.000 --> 10:29.560
Throw it away!

10:29.640 --> 10:30.200
Come on.

10:31.120 --> 10:31.840
Coward.

10:32.360 --> 10:32.880
Taotao.

10:33.160 --> 10:33.800
No more pranks.

10:34.960 --> 10:35.840
You're so gullible.

10:41.960 --> 10:43.080
You wear it all day.

10:53.760 --> 10:54.400
Huanqing.

10:54.400 --> 10:55.240
Yuyan.

10:57.010 --> 10:57.640
Uncle.

11:01.280 --> 11:02.320
What a coincidence!

11:02.680 --> 11:03.640
Huanqing and Yuyan

11:03.760 --> 11:05.480
stumbled onto Lovers' Bridge.

11:06.040 --> 11:06.840
As a couple,

11:06.880 --> 11:07.600
you should

11:07.720 --> 11:08.680
cross this bridge.

11:09.240 --> 11:10.200
During the Festival,

11:10.320 --> 11:12.360
lovers crossing this bridge

11:12.480 --> 11:14.720
will stay together forever.

11:16.160 --> 11:17.100
Did you hear that?

11:17.280 --> 11:18.840
Stay together forever.

11:19.280 --> 11:21.240
What a dreadful curse.

11:22.720 --> 11:23.440
True.

11:25.040 --> 11:25.620
Look!

11:26.040 --> 11:27.400
This is the Lovers' Bridge.

11:28.600 --> 11:30.670
Only genuine lovers

11:31.160 --> 11:32.960
can cross it together.

11:39.320 --> 11:40.280
They can't match me.

11:40.500 --> 11:42.440
I've crossed it four times.

11:47.360 --> 11:50.160
You're quite romantic.

11:53.720 --> 11:54.920
If I were him,

11:55.080 --> 11:56.680
I'd cross just once in my life,

11:56.760 --> 11:58.280
with one person only.

12:06.240 --> 12:07.760
What a rare opportunity!

12:08.040 --> 12:08.560
Huanqing.

12:08.560 --> 12:09.200
Yuyan.

12:09.560 --> 12:10.520
Go give it a try!

12:11.560 --> 12:12.080
Exactly.

12:12.320 --> 12:12.960
Go ahead.

12:13.680 --> 12:14.360
Give it a try.

12:16.080 --> 12:17.120
Crossing the bridge

12:17.240 --> 12:19.000
is about the courage and love

12:19.160 --> 12:20.560
to move forward together.

12:21.040 --> 12:21.640
Love

12:21.760 --> 12:22.960
brings you courage.

12:23.320 --> 12:24.840
Courage born from love

12:25.000 --> 12:26.160
makes you invincible.

12:26.290 --> 12:26.840
Moreover,

12:27.000 --> 12:28.120
the princess favors

12:28.120 --> 12:29.720
lovers with unbreakable bonds.

12:30.080 --> 12:31.560
If you two cross this bridge,

12:31.840 --> 12:32.760
it'll make it easier

12:32.880 --> 12:34.040
for you

12:34.320 --> 12:35.600
to visit the princess.

12:35.840 --> 12:36.370
Okay.

12:40.840 --> 12:41.550
What?

12:42.920 --> 12:43.600
Nothing.

12:45.160 --> 12:47.120
You make great sacrifices

12:47.440 --> 12:48.720
to meet Princess Mengji.

12:57.640 --> 12:58.400
Be careful.

12:59.000 --> 12:59.920
Hold onto me.

13:01.560 --> 13:03.840
This bridge looks unstable.

13:04.280 --> 13:05.680
Crossing it together

13:06.080 --> 13:08.080
might compromise your reputation, no?

13:10.480 --> 13:11.760
If you can't handle it,

13:12.340 --> 13:12.880
then...

13:12.880 --> 13:13.550
Never mind.

13:13.880 --> 13:15.320
To meet the princess earlier,

13:15.520 --> 13:16.800
let's get it over with

13:17.240 --> 13:18.720
quickly now.

13:20.000 --> 13:20.680
Made it

13:20.720 --> 13:22.400
sound like we're going to die.

13:24.120 --> 13:24.960
You made it sound

13:25.160 --> 13:25.840
like I'm going

13:25.880 --> 13:27.200
to live and die with you.

13:30.720 --> 13:31.680
We can live together,

13:32.520 --> 13:33.320
not die together.

14:10.350 --> 14:11.080
Commander.

14:11.520 --> 14:13.720
Should we use Qinggong?

14:14.000 --> 14:15.760
Or we pretend we're stuck,

14:15.840 --> 14:16.440
falling down?

14:16.800 --> 14:17.680
Someone will help us.

14:18.960 --> 14:19.800
Grab my collar.

14:22.000 --> 14:22.560
Quickly.

14:26.160 --> 14:26.840
Hold tight.

14:36.200 --> 14:37.320
It's so shaky.

14:37.760 --> 14:39.000
Will they fall?

14:39.320 --> 14:40.080
No.

14:40.400 --> 14:41.780
They're not like us.

14:43.080 --> 14:44.120
What do you mean?

14:44.520 --> 14:45.400
Are you implying

14:45.440 --> 14:46.080
we'd fall?

14:46.480 --> 14:47.440
They know martial arts.

14:47.520 --> 14:48.400
But we don't.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.040
Let's watch.

14:52.240 --> 14:53.200
How about making a bet?

14:54.840 --> 14:55.960
Let's cross that bridge too.

14:56.120 --> 14:57.480
I bet we won't fall.

14:58.160 --> 14:59.160
Should I then bet

14:59.160 --> 14:59.840
that we'll fall?

14:59.960 --> 15:00.640
That's madness!

15:01.640 --> 15:02.760
Are you going or not?

15:04.640 --> 15:05.200
Sure.

15:05.620 --> 15:06.200
Go.

15:29.480 --> 15:30.000
Sorry.

15:35.320 --> 15:36.720
(This is worse than daily drills)

15:36.760 --> 15:37.760
(at the training field.)

16:02.200 --> 16:02.760
Almost there.

16:15.410 --> 16:21.840
♪Before fate is confirmed♪

16:22.260 --> 16:28.210
♪My love rests between your fingers♪

16:28.910 --> 16:33.070
♪Farewell tears blurred my sight♪

16:33.070 --> 16:35.810
♪Indescribable yearnings♪

16:37.170 --> 16:39.440
♪Awaiting the spread of moonlight♪

16:39.440 --> 16:40.520
Sir, keep moving!

16:51.480 --> 16:52.080
Go.

16:53.390 --> 16:54.140
Oh.

17:12.440 --> 17:13.040
Well done,

17:13.119 --> 17:14.359
my nephew indeed, Huanqing.

17:14.520 --> 17:15.540
Did it on the first try.

17:15.720 --> 17:16.440
I feared

17:16.560 --> 17:17.680
that if you failed,

17:17.720 --> 17:19.000
you might never try again.

17:19.920 --> 17:21.520
Surprisingly,

17:21.560 --> 17:23.400
you easily crossed the Lovers' Bridge.

17:23.800 --> 17:24.640
That's good.

17:25.119 --> 17:27.040
Since you crossed the Lovers' Bridge,

17:27.560 --> 17:28.280
in this life,

17:28.480 --> 17:30.880
the two of you

17:31.360 --> 17:32.480
will never part.

17:33.040 --> 17:33.720
Indeed.

17:34.120 --> 17:35.080
They will never part.

17:36.200 --> 17:37.140
Where are

17:37.400 --> 17:39.120
Mr. Cheng and Miss Song?

17:39.200 --> 17:39.880
They are

17:40.000 --> 17:41.760
crossing the Lovers' Bridge now.

17:50.440 --> 17:51.200
Careful!

17:53.280 --> 17:54.120
As one

17:54.560 --> 17:56.000
of the Capital's Four Young Masters,

17:56.360 --> 17:57.400
I'm reduced to doing this.

17:57.720 --> 17:58.760
It's utterly undignified.

17:59.200 --> 18:00.880
Maybe we should quit.

18:01.160 --> 18:02.000
Cheng Lisu!

18:02.360 --> 18:03.200
If you retreat now,

18:03.480 --> 18:04.800
I'll beat you up.

18:17.360 --> 18:18.440
Infuriating!

18:20.000 --> 18:21.440
Crossing the bridge or not?

18:24.080 --> 18:24.680
Let's do it!

18:28.320 --> 18:29.280
What a surprise!

18:29.720 --> 18:31.480
They bicker all the time.

18:31.560 --> 18:32.640
They are actually a couple.

18:32.720 --> 18:33.560
Exactly.

18:35.040 --> 18:35.640
Right,

18:36.120 --> 18:36.960
back then,

18:37.320 --> 18:38.640
I used to tug the braids

18:38.680 --> 18:40.120
of the girl next door.

18:40.560 --> 18:41.400
That feeling...

18:51.400 --> 18:52.080
Great!

18:52.360 --> 18:53.760
We're already halfway done.

18:55.040 --> 18:56.280
Victory is within reach.

18:56.280 --> 18:57.490
We absolutely cannot give up.

18:57.550 --> 18:58.120
Hmm.

19:02.320 --> 19:03.280
- Good!
- Good!

19:03.700 --> 19:05.810
- Good!
- One more!

19:05.970 --> 19:07.280
Look at that one up ahead.

19:07.920 --> 19:09.330
- It's beautiful.
- More!

19:09.550 --> 19:11.130
- Great!
- Great!

19:16.800 --> 19:20.520
- Great!
- Great!

19:25.960 --> 19:28.680
- Great!
- Great!

19:29.200 --> 19:29.960
Another one!

19:30.960 --> 19:31.840
Mr. Cui.

19:32.760 --> 19:33.520
What a coincidence!

19:33.640 --> 19:34.320
Mr. Cui.

19:34.920 --> 19:36.360
Miss Yan, Miss Ling.

19:36.360 --> 19:37.120
Why haven't I seen

19:37.160 --> 19:38.120
your parents around?

19:38.320 --> 19:40.080
Our parents are on the boat.

19:40.360 --> 19:41.160
Min'er and I

19:41.160 --> 19:42.120
came out with servants

19:42.240 --> 19:43.080
for a stroll.

19:43.400 --> 19:44.400
We'll see the ceremony

19:44.400 --> 19:46.000
and bring back some offerings.

19:51.440 --> 19:53.520
- Great!
- Great!

19:53.880 --> 19:54.440
Why are they

19:54.440 --> 19:55.480
wearing masks?

19:55.520 --> 19:56.400
Each mask

19:56.400 --> 19:57.800
represents an identity.

19:58.280 --> 19:59.520
These are related to legends

19:59.520 --> 20:00.800
about the Water God.

20:01.080 --> 20:01.920
During the ceremony,

20:01.920 --> 20:03.680
everyone sings and dances together

20:03.960 --> 20:05.360
to spread the legends

20:05.360 --> 20:06.720
about the Water God.

20:07.280 --> 20:08.520
It's fascinating.

20:09.040 --> 20:10.700
If you're interested,

20:10.920 --> 20:12.400
you can dance with them

20:12.960 --> 20:14.160
and play a character.

20:14.600 --> 20:15.640
After it concludes,

20:16.040 --> 20:18.600
an elder will dip willow branches
in blessed water

20:18.760 --> 20:20.680
and sprinkle the water on everyone.

20:21.280 --> 20:22.480
The blessed water

20:22.680 --> 20:24.280
will bring you good fortune.

20:25.200 --> 20:26.520
Why let her join?

20:28.640 --> 20:30.800
Min'er and I also
want to dance on stage.

20:31.060 --> 20:31.840
If Mrs. Qiao

20:32.000 --> 20:33.360
joins us,

20:33.440 --> 20:34.640
it'll be better.

20:36.960 --> 20:37.550
Alright!

20:37.960 --> 20:39.080
But I don't usually dance.

20:39.280 --> 20:40.520
You won't laugh at me, right?

20:40.680 --> 20:41.280
Of course not.

20:41.440 --> 20:42.600
We'll teach you.

20:45.140 --> 20:46.000
What's this?

20:47.240 --> 20:48.600
If she doesn't participate,

20:48.960 --> 20:50.560
how can we make a fool of her?

20:54.200 --> 20:55.640
We'll go get masks then.

20:56.280 --> 20:56.960
Go ahead.

20:59.440 --> 21:00.000
Good.

21:02.840 --> 21:04.240
You know they have ill intentions.

21:04.880 --> 21:05.720
Why not refuse?

21:07.630 --> 21:09.040
I'll play it by ear.

21:09.400 --> 21:10.040
Besides,

21:10.320 --> 21:11.960
even if I decline, they will try again.

21:12.360 --> 21:13.560
I want to see what tricks

21:13.560 --> 21:14.520
they're going to play.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.880
You really never stop thinking of

21:19.960 --> 21:20.920
becoming a general.

21:21.800 --> 21:22.680
Absolutely.

21:26.200 --> 21:26.720
Come on.

21:28.200 --> 21:29.200
They're waving at me now.

21:29.600 --> 21:30.640
I'll go over.

21:30.640 --> 21:31.270
Hmm.

21:32.750 --> 21:34.040
How interesting!

21:35.080 --> 21:37.320
- Great!
- Great!

21:37.360 --> 21:38.120
Look!

21:38.360 --> 21:38.920
Mr. Cui.

21:45.360 --> 21:46.160
Is something wrong?

21:47.520 --> 21:48.120
A minor issue.

21:48.360 --> 21:49.400
Enjoy yourselves

21:49.840 --> 21:50.760
and have fun.

21:53.640 --> 21:57.040
- Great!
- Great!

21:57.280 --> 21:59.760
(Looks like something big happened.)

22:27.360 --> 22:28.240
Mrs. Qiao.

22:29.400 --> 22:30.240
There are many people

22:30.360 --> 22:31.560
at today's ritual ceremony.

22:31.840 --> 22:33.000
The ceremony master mentioned

22:33.160 --> 22:34.080
that these masks

22:34.120 --> 22:35.480
must be assigned by lottery.

22:35.720 --> 22:37.240
Why don't you draw a lot too?

22:38.000 --> 22:40.120
What's different about these masks?

22:40.960 --> 22:42.160
Different masks

22:42.200 --> 22:43.760
represent different roles.

22:44.360 --> 22:45.160
In the myths

22:45.200 --> 22:46.600
of the Water God,

22:46.880 --> 22:48.760
there are villains and buffoons.

22:49.280 --> 22:50.080
Who knows

22:50.240 --> 22:52.000
which unlucky soul will draw them?

22:52.800 --> 22:54.240
I believe you won't

22:54.240 --> 22:55.080
draw any of them.

22:56.720 --> 22:57.280
Alright!

23:05.950 --> 23:07.440
(Liar Fox)

23:07.440 --> 23:08.440
Liar Fox.

23:12.020 --> 23:13.200
It's actually Liar Fox?

23:13.920 --> 23:15.200
How unfortunate!

23:15.600 --> 23:16.840
What's wrong with this role?

23:18.200 --> 23:20.240
He's a vicious liar

23:20.560 --> 23:22.520
who did evils near water sources.

23:23.000 --> 23:24.720
He swindled people's fortunes,

23:25.240 --> 23:27.160
even targeting elders and children.

23:27.880 --> 23:29.680
The most shameless things

23:29.720 --> 23:30.840
were all done by him.

23:31.680 --> 23:33.000
The deities could

23:33.080 --> 23:34.120
no longer tolerate this.

23:34.480 --> 23:35.960
They sent a man of the Water God,

23:36.320 --> 23:37.760
an immortal, to subdue him.

23:38.520 --> 23:39.160
Then?

23:41.400 --> 23:42.320
The deceiver

23:42.400 --> 23:44.280
could tell countless lies to others,

23:44.840 --> 23:46.480
but under the immortal's magic,

23:46.680 --> 23:48.600
he could only speak truths.

23:49.160 --> 23:50.680
He confessed ten secrets

23:50.720 --> 23:51.640
about himself.

23:52.040 --> 23:54.240
Finally, he was imprisoned
in an underwater dungeon,

23:54.680 --> 23:56.200
never to set foot on land again.

23:57.420 --> 23:58.420
Oh.

23:59.480 --> 24:00.560
How tragic!

24:01.200 --> 24:02.040
It is tragic indeed.

24:02.520 --> 24:03.240
However,

24:03.280 --> 24:05.120
since you've drawn that role,

24:05.280 --> 24:06.680
you must play Liar Fox.

24:07.520 --> 24:10.040
If you accept to join the ritual

24:10.160 --> 24:11.680
but later withdraw,

24:11.890 --> 24:13.120
you'll be punished

24:13.160 --> 24:14.560
by the Water God.

24:20.040 --> 24:20.720
Fine.

24:21.160 --> 24:22.520
I can be a buffoon.

24:22.720 --> 24:23.680
Someone

24:23.800 --> 24:25.080
has to play it, right?

24:34.360 --> 24:35.480
As you said,

24:35.720 --> 24:36.800
Liar Fox must tell secrets

24:37.080 --> 24:38.280
to the immortal, right?

24:38.800 --> 24:39.560
Correct.

24:40.400 --> 24:41.280
The secrets

24:41.320 --> 24:42.920
must be genuine.

24:43.480 --> 24:44.440
So, Mrs. Qiao,

24:44.480 --> 24:46.360
you have to reveal ten secrets of yours.

24:47.560 --> 24:48.440
The so-called immortal

24:48.520 --> 24:49.360
is just a madman

24:49.360 --> 24:50.960
who snoops into others' secrets.

24:51.680 --> 24:53.280
That's the immortal's mask.

25:02.080 --> 25:03.240
Let me play the immortal.

25:04.040 --> 25:04.840
Why?

25:06.520 --> 25:07.560
We already have someone

25:07.600 --> 25:08.560
play that role.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.280
My wife's secrets

25:10.960 --> 25:12.480
shouldn't be heard by others.

25:27.720 --> 25:28.360
Put it on.

25:37.320 --> 25:37.920
Let me help.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.720
Haven't you worn masks before?

25:49.960 --> 25:51.040
It's not that hard.

26:01.840 --> 26:02.800
You've worn many?

26:05.920 --> 26:08.000
Perhaps I wear masks in my dreams.

26:44.640 --> 26:45.900
How should we dance?

26:46.000 --> 26:46.800
I have no idea.

26:49.040 --> 26:50.800
Miss Ling mentioned

26:50.830 --> 26:52.270
that Liar Fox must tell the immortal

26:52.270 --> 26:53.200
ten secrets.

26:53.680 --> 26:54.680
Now that we're here,

26:55.000 --> 26:55.760
let me tell you

26:55.800 --> 26:56.760
my ten secrets.

26:57.240 --> 26:57.800
Go ahead.

26:58.400 --> 26:58.990
I'm listening.

27:00.200 --> 27:00.960
I will

27:01.120 --> 27:01.800
start dancing.

27:06.720 --> 27:07.920
I used to handle alcohol well,

27:08.120 --> 27:08.960
but now I can't.

27:10.480 --> 27:12.360
I've memorized Wuzi's Art of War.

27:13.720 --> 27:15.250
I'm the number one in Yezhou Garrison.

27:16.320 --> 27:17.600
My favorite dish

27:17.960 --> 27:19.400
is mushroom and chicken stew.

27:22.120 --> 27:23.360
I gave Lisu's jade pendant

27:23.560 --> 27:25.080
to the courtesans

27:25.440 --> 27:26.800
of Wanhua Pavilion.

27:27.880 --> 27:28.960
How impressive!

27:31.120 --> 27:32.360
In my eyes,

27:32.760 --> 27:34.200
Commander is a good man.

27:35.720 --> 27:36.800
I'm deeply grateful to him.

27:37.320 --> 27:38.280
What a smooth talker.

27:39.520 --> 27:41.400
Every time Commander misunderstands me,

27:42.400 --> 27:43.600
it breaks my heart.

27:44.960 --> 27:45.640
Go on.

27:48.600 --> 27:49.480
Commander and I met

27:49.720 --> 27:50.880
in a former life.

27:53.640 --> 27:56.280
I was once a general.

27:57.040 --> 27:57.720
I thought

27:58.080 --> 27:59.160
you'd say "I will be."

28:00.280 --> 28:01.320
The last secret.

28:05.560 --> 28:06.800
I love the moon.

28:07.120 --> 28:08.240
Yet the moon doesn't know.

28:10.320 --> 28:11.220
That's all.

28:15.120 --> 28:22.320
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

28:22.320 --> 28:26.760
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

28:26.760 --> 28:30.780
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

28:31.120 --> 28:37.230
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

29:07.040 --> 29:08.400
Jiyang has many famous views.

29:09.240 --> 29:10.160
But only the fireflies

29:10.160 --> 29:11.440
at the Firefly Spring

29:12.120 --> 29:13.120
are truly renowned.

29:13.640 --> 29:14.560
It really is beautiful.

29:28.280 --> 29:28.840
Commander.

29:29.680 --> 29:30.680
Why are you being so kind

29:30.800 --> 29:31.840
to me today?

29:33.960 --> 29:35.160
Isn't today your birthday?

29:37.600 --> 29:38.520
How did you know?

29:39.720 --> 29:40.960
You are

29:41.360 --> 29:42.280
not a good liar.

29:42.840 --> 29:43.560
Sometimes,

29:44.080 --> 29:45.200
your lies are flawed.

29:47.200 --> 29:48.240
Sometimes,

29:48.560 --> 29:49.800
you speak truths or tell lies.

29:50.120 --> 29:51.120
It's hard to tell.

29:51.840 --> 29:52.520
Frankly,

29:53.600 --> 29:54.800
we're the same sort.

30:03.800 --> 30:04.530
On your birthday,

30:05.160 --> 30:06.120
don't you make a wish?

30:07.760 --> 30:08.360
Go ahead.

30:09.160 --> 30:10.080
Finish your birthday.

30:15.080 --> 30:16.280
I have no wishes.

30:18.200 --> 30:19.960
Making a wish

30:20.520 --> 30:22.120
is just self-deception.

30:22.880 --> 30:23.880
Whatever I desire,

30:24.480 --> 30:25.720
I'll get it myself.

30:28.680 --> 30:29.200
That's it?

30:33.720 --> 30:35.120
I thought you would

30:36.040 --> 30:37.280
wish for promotions and honors

30:38.160 --> 30:39.280
or military achievements.

30:45.040 --> 30:45.600
Commander.

30:46.680 --> 30:47.800
Haven't you noticed

30:48.560 --> 30:50.040
that since we met,

30:51.400 --> 30:53.480
I've always pretended
to be someone else?

30:55.680 --> 30:57.000
For example, Cheng Lisu

30:57.720 --> 30:58.880
and Wen Yuyan.

30:59.320 --> 31:00.080
Who knows

31:00.640 --> 31:02.600
who I'll pretend to be next?

31:14.960 --> 31:15.800
Do you feel wronged?

31:16.480 --> 31:17.360
Not exactly.

31:18.360 --> 31:19.240
But I'm afraid

31:21.800 --> 31:22.440
after pretending

31:22.440 --> 31:24.080
to be someone else for too long,

31:25.240 --> 31:27.040
I might forget who I really am.

31:29.490 --> 31:30.800
♪I've seen the mountains♪

31:30.800 --> 31:32.560
♪And trodden through ice♪

31:32.560 --> 31:34.440
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

31:34.440 --> 31:35.280
I hope

31:37.040 --> 31:38.840
there's someone in this world

31:40.000 --> 31:41.200
who comes for me.

31:41.680 --> 31:43.120
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

31:43.120 --> 31:44.520
♪Gazing through the mire♪

31:44.840 --> 31:46.240
(Not for He Rufei.)

31:47.400 --> 31:49.000
(Not for General Feihong.)

31:50.480 --> 31:51.920
(Just for me.)

31:53.320 --> 31:54.320
(Coming for me.)

31:54.420 --> 31:57.310
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

31:57.310 --> 31:59.700
♪There must always be a longing♪

32:00.430 --> 32:05.620
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

32:05.900 --> 32:08.120
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

32:08.120 --> 32:11.880
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

32:11.880 --> 32:14.000
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

32:14.000 --> 32:18.290
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

32:18.290 --> 32:20.400
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

32:21.640 --> 32:22.200
Commander.

32:22.800 --> 32:24.640
You must remember my name.

32:25.320 --> 32:25.960
I am...

32:26.040 --> 32:26.720
He Yan.

32:33.600 --> 32:34.480
I'll remember.

